.TH INDI_TYR_TELESCOPE 1 "October 2026" "Tyr INDI 0.3.0" "INDI telescope drivers"
.SH NAME
indi_tyr_telescope \- INDI driver for the Prometheus Astro Tyr telescope mount
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B indiserver
.RI [ server-options ]
.B indi_tyr_telescope
.SH DESCRIPTION
The driver controls Tyr harmonic-drive telescope mounts through USB serial or
TCP/IP. It is normally launched by an INDI server or an Ekos equipment profile.
Choose Prometheus Astro Tyr as the telescope driver.
.PP
Supported operations include GoTo, Sync, manual motion, tracking, pulse guiding,
Home, Park, precise shared slew speed and mount configuration. Bluetooth and
Wi-Fi configuration are displayed according to firmware capabilities.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Use the INDI client's Connection tab. For USB choose Serial, the CP2102 device
and 9600 baud. For IP choose Network, TCP, the mount address and command port
(normally 9999). TCP requires Tyr firmware v1.2.10 or later. UDP is unsupported.
.PP
Keep the polling interval below the firmware's ten-second TCP idle timeout.
The default driver interval is one second.
.PP
Tyr stores UTC minus local standard time, excluding daylight saving. This is
separate from the INDI client offset. For Athens, the mount setting is -2
year-round while the client can report +3 during summer.
.SH OPERATION
Settings are read on connection and after saves. Read buttons refresh settings
changed through another interface. Stop movement and guiding before changing
limits or backlash. Motor, Home and network edits also require tracking off.
Motor, geometry and network changes require restart. Network edits remain pending
until Apply; blank password fields retain saved passwords.
.PP
Home and alignment can move the mount. Verify rig and cable clearance. Firmware
installation uses Tyr's supported USB tools or web updater, outside this driver.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/share/indi/indi_tyr.xml
registers the driver with INDI clients.
.PP
.I /usr/share/doc/indi-tyr/index.md
contains the full user guide.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR indiserver (1)
.PP
https://prometheusastro.com/
